    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agent duly authorized inwriting, before me at Polgahawela Divisional Secretariat on30.11.2018 at 10.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notify tome in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16.11..2018 thenature of their interest in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land,the amount of compensation and the details of the computationof such amount.",
